This PR adds an ability to put csv files into the common folder, for each tax export, create a folder and add the 3 files inside there. Basic changes:
  - Adds ability to put csv files into a common folder
  - Add test coverage for the tax reports csv

**Request example** for the first part of the tax export:
```json
{
    "auth": {
        "email": "user@mail.com"
    },
    "method": "getFullTaxReportCsv",
    "params": {
        "start": 1587519905000,
        "end": 1597519905000,
        "isStartSnapshot": true
    }
}
```

**Request example** for the second part of the tax export:
```json
{
    "auth": {
        "email": "user@mail.com"
    },
    "method": "getFullTaxReportCsv",
    "params": {
        "start": 1587519905000,
        "end": 1597519905000,
        "isEndSnapshot": true
    }
}
```

**Request example** for the third part of the tax export:
```json
{
    "auth": {
        "email": "user@mail.com"
    },
    "method": "getFullTaxReportCsv",
    "params": {
        "start": 1587519905000,
        "end": 1597519905000
    }
}
```

Those requests create the following csv files in a common folder, by default:
  - `csv/user_full-tax-report_FROM_Wed-Apr-22-2020_TO_Sat-Aug-15-2020`
      - `user_full-tax-report_START_SNAPSHOT_Fri-Jan-08-2021.csv`
      - `user_full-tax-report_END_SNAPSHOT_Fri-Jan-08-2021.csv`
      - `user_full-tax-report_FULL_PERIOD_Fri-Jan-08-2021.csv`

**Depends** on this PR:
  - https://github.com/bitfinexcom/bfx-report/pull/204

